flowchart TD
    U[Pengunjung]
    FE[Frontend]
    API[API NestJS]
    DB[(MariaDB)]
    MAIL[(SMTP)]

    U -->|1. isi formulir daftar| FE
    FE -->|2. POST /users  Basic| API
