    U -->|7. POST /auth {email,password}| API
    API -->|8. verifikasi + tanda tangan JWT {uuid,role}| DB
    API -->|9. kembalikan token| FE
    FE -->|10. simpan token di cookie httpOnly| FE

    style U fill:#eef2ff
